om/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T07:30:43-07:00","id":1448125,"title":"","content":"<br /> Are there new Lore Sheet and Discipline Powers in every issue?<br /> If so, that is a cheap trick to sell more comics - making player of the TTRPG be forced to buy every isue ti get all the upplements to their game, even if they are not interested in comics.<br /> <br /> <br /> My thoughts after reading #1<br /> <br /> * The story felt convaluted and i did not feel for any of the chracters.<br /> * The pace of jumpping between the anarchs and the Cams was a bit disrupting of the flow.<br /> * How an Elder toreador can be killed so simmply is beyond me.<br /> * The drawing style was a 3/5<br /> * The Story was a 1/5, even Kindred the Embraced was better and felt more Vampire the Masquerade.<br /> * The atmosphere it set was a 2/5<br /> <br /> All in all I would say a 2/5 grade.<br /> <br /> I will have to convince the library to buy every issue and just photocopy what I need for my games.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Edit by Mod: Moved here because it is the comic discussion thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-10-2021, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25995-ethryo","name":"Ethryo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-10T09:45:19-07:00","id":1448136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ethryo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414345-vampire-the-masquerade-winter-s-teeth-discussion-thread?p=1448125#post1448125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there new Lore Sheet and Discipline Powers in every issue?<br /> If so, that is a cheap trick to sell more comics - making player of the TTRPG be forced to buy every isue ti get all the upplements to their game, even if they are not interested in comics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to belabor the point but isn't that by nature of the beast good marketing? Selling you a product you wouldn't normally buy?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\